{"id": "es-l01", "lang": "es", "size": "long", "domain": "medical", "status": "done", "reason": null, "turns": 1, "H_ms": 518.8083332378883, "release_lag_ms": 454.7, "H_minus_lag_ms": 64.1, "first_H_ms": 518.8083332378883, "tail_est_ms": 2234.5, "server_marks": {"spec_start": 138.4, "spec_hit": 491, "mt_first_token": -6655.7, "mt_first_chunk": -6636.8, "tts_request": -6636.7, "tts_first_byte": -6106.3, "tail_tts_first_byte": 1778.2, "audio_first_sent": 0.8, "stt_final": 723.6}, "browser_marks": {"commit_sent": 456.30000019067666, "first_audible": 518.8083332378883}, "source": "Hace una semana empecé a tomar la medicina nueva. Desde entonces tengo mareos por la mañana. A veces también siento náuseas después de comer. ", "target": "A week ago, I started taking the new medicine. Since then I’ve been getting dizzy in the mornings. Sometimes I also feel nauseous after eating.", "reference": "I started taking the new medicine a week ago. Since then I've been dizzy in the mornings. Sometimes I also feel nauseous after eating.", "n": 38, "t_s": 404.5}
